Refrain
Nearer my home, Nearer my home, Nearer my home today, today,Than e'er I've been before.
2 Nearer my Father's house, Where many mansions be, Nearer today, the great white throne, Nearer the crystal sea.
3 Nearer the bound of life, Where burdens are laid down; Nearer to leave the heavy cross, Nearer to gain the crown.
