5 Father, perfect my trust! Strengthen my pow'r of faith! Nor let me stand, at last, alone Upon the shore of death.
6 Be Thee near when my feet Are slipping over the brink, For it may I'm nearer home, Nearer now than I think.
 
708 - There Is a Gate That Stands Ajar
