1 Just over the mountains in the Promised Land, Lies the holy city built by God's own hand; As our weary footsteps gain the mountain's crest, We can view our homeland of eternal rest.
Refrain
We are nearing home! We are nearing homer See the splendor gleaming from the domes afar! See the glory streaming through the "gates ajar'" There we soon will enter, nevermore to roam, Hear the angels singing' we are nearing home! We are nearing home.
